# Specs and plans

`docs/superpowers/specs/` is the design source of truth. Plans in `docs/superpowers/plans/` are checkbox steps; each task ends in one English conventional commit (`feat:`, `fix:`).

Later specs override earlier ones **only** where they say so. Read the 「本文覆盖并取代」 block at the top before treating a rule as current.

- `2026-09-10-gamelife-design.md` — economy, gaps, ledger idempotency.
- `2026-09-11-wave1-evidence-and-vision-design.md` — path split, capture context, vision JSON.
- `2026-09-11-observation-engine-design.md` — ScreenCaptureKit + native `macos/`.
- `2026-09-11-judgment-grounded-core-design.md` — `grounded_strong_core`. Idle ≥ 180s was later reinstated as `away` **after distraction, before admin / side**; `reading_bridge` is dead.
- `2026-09-11-planner-shell-design.md` — discounts, slot-pinned snapshots, text AI → vision. Its planner Today page and “no task ⇒ credited = 0” are superseded.
- `2026-09-13-activity-monitor-design.md` + analytics + shop-desire — shell / judgment / 统计 / shop. TickTick-as-planner is superseded by 2026-09-15.
- `2026-09-14-cross-platform-observation-design.md` — Windows / Linux Xorg observation; identity aliases in `known_app_identities`; Wayland out of scope. Overrides 2026-09-10's "no Windows".
- `2026-09-14-cloud-sync-design.md` — WebDAV / S3 snapshot + multi-device ledger. Does not replace judgment/economy. T15 / T16 not started. `task_lists` / `tasks` now stay in the snapshot copy.
- `2026-09-15-local-tasks-design.md` — fifth rail tab 任务; local groups + NL + drawn calendar replace TickTick as the plan source.

UI copy and spec/plan prose stay Chinese. Task CRUD and the drawn calendar live on 任务 (`Tasks.tsx`); do not put FullCalendar or dnd-kit in.
